WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.150 --> 00:00:02.470
- Remington is being sued
because its guns were used

00:00:02.470 --> 00:00:05.040
in the Sandy Hook massacre from years ago.

00:00:05.040 --> 00:00:07.020
And as part of this ongoing litigation,

00:00:07.020 --> 00:00:08.480
the plaintiffs claim that Remington

00:00:08.480 --> 00:00:11.760
is trying to bury them in
paperwork in discovery.

00:00:11.760 --> 00:00:13.300
As you know, discovery is the process

00:00:13.300 --> 00:00:15.640
where one party gets more
information from another,

00:00:15.640 --> 00:00:18.000
and the plaintiffs are claiming
that Remington has provided

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:21.130
tens of thousands of
GIFs, memes, and videos

00:00:21.130 --> 00:00:23.040
completely unrelated to anything

00:00:23.040 --> 00:00:24.970
in response to their discovery requests,

00:00:24.970 --> 00:00:28.210
like Santa Claus, this
couple, and filet minion.

00:00:28.210 --> 00:00:31.210
Now, that's not abnormal,
often you'll have a request

00:00:31.210 --> 00:00:33.670
that's broad in discovery
and that discovery request

00:00:33.670 --> 00:00:35.050
will include a whole bunch of stuff

00:00:35.050 --> 00:00:37.110
and the other side will try
and bury you in paperwork

00:00:37.110 --> 00:00:38.240
and provide you everything

00:00:38.240 --> 00:00:39.580
that is responsive to that request.

00:00:39.580 --> 00:00:41.660
But what is unusual, and
is particularly telling,

00:00:41.660 --> 00:00:45.170
is that Remington has
only provided 2,300 emails

00:00:45.170 --> 00:00:47.160
over several years of communication.

00:00:47.160 --> 00:00:48.950
That's not how corporations work,

00:00:48.950 --> 00:00:51.680
there are tons and tons
of more responsive emails

00:00:51.680 --> 00:00:52.513
and corporate documents,

00:00:52.513 --> 00:00:54.300
it just means that Remington
hasn't provided them.

00:00:54.300 --> 00:00:56.090
So it looks like because motion to compel

00:00:56.090 --> 00:00:57.130
probably holds some water

00:00:57.130 --> 00:00:59.230
and we're going to see Remington in court.

